// t_75de19a1 INDEPENDENT control for the float4 return: `.gggg`, a swizzle
// broadcast that never goes through the vector constructor.  The reference
// compiles it and float4(s) to identical 272-byte containers.  Ours agree on
// the broadcast MOV's decoded fields (mask xyzw, source lane y) but not yet
// on bytes: float4(s) lands in a temp and is copied to R0 by the return
// store, one MOV the reference does not emit (t_e3af5f18).
float4 main(float2 uv : TEXCOORD0, uniform sampler2D image) : COLOR
{
    return tex2D(image, uv).gggg;
}
